               from the SCXML "1s"/"500ms"/"0.5s" grammar into integer
               milliseconds (parser.rs `parse_delay_to_ms`); ill-formed
               grammar yields 0 there, which here schedules an immediately-
               ready event — same observable shape as the cpp
               `SendSchedulingHelper::parseDelayString` path. The send id
